    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>http://www.modiag.it#08021728</IRI>
        <Literal>Does the patient engage in repetitive activities, such as pacing around the house, handling buttons, wrapping strings, or doing other things repeatedly?</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>http://www.modiag.it#08021728</IRI>
        <Literal>NPIQ_Presence_of_Aberrant_Motor_Behavior_Item</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>http://www.modiag.it#08021729</IRI>
        <Literal>Is the patient stubborn and resistive to help from others?</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>http://www.modiag.it#08021729</IRI>
        <Literal>NPIQ_Presence_of_Agitation_Aggression_Item</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>http://www.modiag.it#08021730</IRI>
        <Literal>Does the patient become upset when separated from you? Does he/she have any other signs of nervousness, such as shortness of breath, sighing, being unable to relax, or feeling excessively tense?</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>http://www.modiag.it#08021730</IRI>
        <Literal>NPIQ_Presence_of_Anxiety_Item</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>http://www.modiag.it#08021731</IRI>
        <Literal>Does the patient seem less interested in his/her usual activities and in the activities and plans of others?</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>http://www.modiag.it#08021731</IRI>
        <Literal>NPIQ_Presence_of_Apathy_Indifference_Item</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>http://www.modiag.it#08021732</IRI>
        <Literal>Does the patient believe that others are stealing from him/her, or planning to harm him/her in some way?</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>http://www.modiag.it#08021732</IRI>
        <Literal>NPIQ_Presence_of_Delusions_Item</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>http://www.modiag.it#08021733</IRI>
        <Literal>Does the patient act as if he/she is sad or in low spirits? Does he/she cry?</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>http://www.modiag.it#08021733</IRI>
        <Literal>NPIQ_Presence_of_Depression_Dysphoria_Item</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>http://www.modiag.it#08021734</IRI>
        <Literal>Does the patient seem to act impulsively? For example, does the patient talk to strangers as if he/she knows them, or does the patient say things that may hurt people&apos;s feelings?</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>http://www.modiag.it#08021734</IRI>
        <Literal>NPIQ_Presence_of_Dishinibition_Item</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>http://www.modiag.it#08021735</IRI>
        <Literal>Does the patient appear to feel too good or act excessively happy?</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>http://www.modiag.it#08021735</IRI>
        <Literal>NPIQ_Presence_of_Elation_Euphoria_Item</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>http://www.modiag.it#08021736</IRI>
        <Literal>Does the patient have hallucinations such as false visions or
voices? Does he or she seem to hear or see things that are
not present?</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>http://www.modiag.it#08021736</IRI>
        <Literal>NPIQ_Presence_of_Hallucinations_Item</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>http://www.modiag.it#08021737</IRI>
        <Literal>Is the patient impatient or cranky? Does he/she have difficulty coping with delays or waiting for planned activities?</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
