        <Literal>Specialized non-fenestrated tightly-joined ENDOTHELIAL CELLS with TIGHT JUNCTIONS that form a transport barrier for certain substances between the cerebral capillaries and the BRAIN tissue.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
