        <IRI>http://www.semanticweb.org/fangli/ontologies/2019/2/untitled-ontology-107#04010218</IRI>
        <Literal>The part of the brain that connects the CEREBRAL HEMISPHERES with the SPINAL CORD. It consists of the MESENCEPHALON; PONS; and MEDULLA OBLONGATA.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
