        <IRI>http://www.semanticweb.org/fangli/ontologies/2019/2/untitled-ontology-107#04010394</IRI>
        <Literal>Lens-shaped structure on the inner aspect of the INTERNAL CAPSULE. The SUBTHALAMIC NUCLEUS and pathways traversing this region are concerned with the integration of somatic motor function.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
