        <IRI>http://www.semanticweb.org/fangli/ontologies/2019/2/untitled-ontology-107#04010412</IRI>
        <Literal>Large subcortical nuclear masses derived from the telencephalon and located in the basal regions of the cerebral hemispheres.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
