        <IRI>http://www.semanticweb.org/fangli/ontologies/2019/2/untitled-ontology-107#04010422</IRI>
        <Literal>Elongated gray mass of the neostriatum located adjacent to the lateral ventricle of the brain.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
