        <IRI>http://www.semanticweb.org/fangli/ontologies/2019/2/untitled-ontology-107#04010434</IRI>
        <Literal>One of four subsections of the hippocampus described by Lorente de No, located furthest from the DENTATE GYRUS.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
