        <Literal>One of the convolutions on the medial surface of the CEREBRAL HEMISPHERES. It surrounds the rostral part of the brain and CORPUS CALLOSUM and forms part of the LIMBIC SYSTEM.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
