        <Literal>Late onset familial Alzheimer disease; Alzheimer Disease 2, Late-Onset; Alzheimer Disease Associated With Apoe4; Alzheimer disease associated with APOE E4; Alzheimer Disease 2</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="unti:MeSH_Unique_ID"/>
        <IRI>http://www.semanticweb.org/fangli/ontologies/2019/2/untitled-ontology-107#06010596</IRI>
        <Literal>C536595</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>http://www.semanticweb.org/fangli/ontologies/2019/2/untitled-ontology-107#06010596</IRI>
        <Literal>Alzheimer_Disease_Type_2</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <Annotation>
            <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="x_1.1:source"/>
            <Literal>UMLS</Literal>
        </Annotation>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="core:definition"/>
        <IRI>http://www.semanticweb.org/fangli/ontologies/2019/2/untitled-ontology-107#06010596</IRI>
        <Literal>A degenerative disease of the brain characterized by the insidious onset of dementia. Impairment of memory, judgment, attention span, and problem solving skills are followed by severe apraxia and a global loss of cognitive abilities. The condition primarily occurs after age 60, and is marked pathologically by severe cortical atrophy and the triad of senile plaques, neurofibrillary tangles, and neuropil threads. [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199]</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="core:exactMatch"/>
        <IRI>http://www.semanticweb.org/fangli/ontologies/2019/2/untitled-ontology-107#06010596</IRI>
        <Literal>Alzheimer disease type 2</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty IRI="#UMLS_CUI"/>
        <IRI>http://www.semanticweb.org/fangli/ontologies/2019/2/untitled-ontology-107#06010596</IRI>
        <Literal>C1863051</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
